@startuml Sequence_Diagram_Lihat_Data_Pesanan
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram - Lihat Data Pesanan

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Halaman Manajemen Pesanan" as UI_List
participant "Halaman Detail Pesanan" as UI_Detail
participant "Sistem" as System
database "Database" as DB

Admin -> UI_List: Akses Halaman Manajemen Pesanan
activate UI_List

UI_List -> System: requestDaftarPesanan()
activate System

System -> DB: fetchDaftarPesanan()
activate DB
DB --> System: daftarPesanan
deactivate DB

System --> UI_List: daftarPesanan
deactivate System

UI_List -> Admin: Tampilkan daftar pesanan

' Alt untuk sorting, bisa ditambahkan jika perlu detail lebih

Admin -> UI_List: Klik nomor pesanan untuk lihat detail

UI_List -> UI_Detail: Buka Halaman Detail Pesanan(orderId)
deactivate UI_List
activate UI_Detail

UI_Detail -> System: requestDetailPesanan(orderId)
activate System

System -> DB: fetchDetailPesanan(orderId)
activate DB
DB --> System: detailPesanan
deactivate DB

System --> UI_Detail: detailPesanan
deactivate System

UI_Detail -> Admin: Tampilkan detail lengkap pesanan
deactivate UI_Detail

@enduml